Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.97,0:22:07.46,ed-kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf90}声{\kf30}も{\kf34}飛{\kf98}び{\kf67}跳{\kf53}ね{\kf177}る
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.97,0:22:07.46,ed-eng,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{}My voice swoops up and down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If your blood type is B, you should be extra cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If left unchecked, things can degrade even further,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,to the point where your very life is at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.21,0:00:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No shows about being sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing to be that scared of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:23.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about we take a bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.75,0:00:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Am I going to die, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What're you saying? You're only six!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We really need to find another nursery soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.89,0:02:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The huge companies that all of the smart guys work at...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.04,0:02:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...are supposed to have their own daycare services and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.73,0:02:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But where on Earth does that actually happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.82,0:02:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kawachi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, did you meet someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:02:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've been heading home pretty early recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You always used to be on the last train home, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.94,0:03:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Last year you clocked up some pretty huge profits for the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.79,0:03:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate, we'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.93,0:03:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was just because I worked my ass off last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't expect those kind of figures all the time.{There isn't really a break in the sentence here with the one above, but it's long enough that you might want to break it?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It comes and goes. They don't call me "Daikichi" for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:15.42,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,TL Note: In Japanese, "Daikichi" means "great fortune".
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.02,0:03:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.15,0:03:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.51,0:03:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Going to the fourth floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. Are you doing as well as ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not so much this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I've just been getting chewed out by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I'm losing my hair over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.93,0:03:36.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do a good job once, and you set the bar really high for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.21,0:03:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Gotou-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.50,0:03:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a mother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,D-Don't act so surprised just because I'm small!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's just that you're pretty thin. I was wondering where you could've fit a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your guess is as good as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.63,0:03:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My kid's already two...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you. Put it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.83,0:03:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like me to go with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:03:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you!{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.46,0:04:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gotou-san's just as tough as always, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.15,0:04:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a shame she didn't stay in sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's been with the company a few years longer than I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And when she got pregnant, she willingly requested a demotion...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...so that she'd be able to make it home on time every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The office was full of gossip about what she had done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! How long are you keeping her for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.86,0:04:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We haven't really decided yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Rin-chan", huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's going through a bed-wetting phase right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems to be really getting to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's psychological?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, though kids sweat a whole lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:49.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and in the winter and autumn, that doesn't happen as much,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.07,0:04:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so they start needing to pee a lot more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah. I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was always told to use the toilet before bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:05:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess her mother must have had a whole lot on her plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:03.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't bring myself to ask her, even if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's really important for a kid to have a mother, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.51,0:05:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Men aren't supposed to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.98,0:05:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What were you up to today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Picture books, staring contests and other stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.84,0:05:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.33,0:05:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.85,0:05:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'll whip up dinner right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The moon's fading away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.77,0:05:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mean with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.65,0:05:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah, she's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.27,0:05:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait. Why are you calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you say that you didn't want to get dragged into this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.43,0:06:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't very well stay out of it when I know she's with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm coming there for the weekend to look for clues about Rin's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.39,0:06:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Then call when the two of you arrive at the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.22,0:06:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be sure she gets wrapped up in something warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, and I'll call Haruko, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her kid and Rin seem to get along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, another car!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.09,0:06:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You look like you're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.55,0:06:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.35,0:06:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, good to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.53,0:06:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.67,0:06:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't really have anything a young child would like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:07:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She seems to like old people's food, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.60,0:07:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Had enough already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.81,0:07:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't come and tell me that you're hungry later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not very hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.70,0:07:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for leaving leftovers.{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.29,0:07:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:19.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.21,0:07:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, what a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.56,0:07:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe that damn family!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.14,0:07:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Onii-chan! You actually took her home!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And now, the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Today, we'll see warm sunlight all across the country...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...with reported temperatures two degrees higher than average.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.84,0:07:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just going to the bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I need to use the bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't go when you're sitting right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is she always like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.39,0:08:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nope. At my place, she talks a lot more than you'd expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And on the train, she was acting like she was on holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.23,0:08:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But when we turned up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.59,0:08:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,she found an old couple who had given her a scare at the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.22,0:08:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, what are you trying to accuse us of?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You idiot! When she sees adults in a bad mood, she thinks that they're mad at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. I suppose a child would...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure the two of you were the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See? Even an insensitive blockhead like you had a heart, once upon a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess Rin just has her head screwed on a little better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.95,0:08:51.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut it, baldy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, you like cat's cradle, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.54,0:09:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, at least answer her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.37,0:09:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.41,0:09:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Watch how Auntie does it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Auntie"? You're more like her grandmother...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.83,0:09:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's not old enough to be a grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a lovely child...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just because she grew up with {\i1}really{\i0} old people...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll show you how to do it, so watch closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My... Did I make a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.61,0:09:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.31,0:09:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This? A four-step ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:56.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A two-step.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:09:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,An aeroplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:09:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.59,0:10:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.99,0:10:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's because this cord is so easy to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.66,0:10:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! I knitted it out of thin wool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.65,0:10:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It has a much better weight than if you use the thread it as is. {Fixed typo, "us" to "use"}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.67,0:10:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! She's good with her hands, so we can teach her otedama, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.67,0:10:20.30,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,TL Note: Otedama is a Japanese children's game involving juggled beanbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.30,0:10:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.71,0:10:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You take your pinkie, and thread it through here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.05,0:10:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,L-Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:33.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One for a rattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.49,0:10:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Two for a wisteria tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's with this? What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I could ask the same about what you're wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.16,0:10:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably Haruko and her daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.70,0:10:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pretty! What are they called?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.36,0:10:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Otedama!{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.82,0:10:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.33,0:10:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's kind of amazing that you're juggling a job and raising a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My husband hardly helps out at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to your granddad's after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.56,0:11:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I figured there might be some clues about Rin's mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I definitely think it's important for a child to have her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.77,0:12:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You could've at least left a will or something, Granddad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Weren't you worried about Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A modem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.99,0:12:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What's that on your head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan did my hair like hers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, now that you mention it, your clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.84,0:12:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're Kazumi-oneechan's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Kazumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.15,0:12:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mum, you can't dress a kid up in old junk like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.26,0:12:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look! I knew they'd suit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well, I guess it's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you put them on a kid today, they actually look kind of modern...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you find anything at your grandfather's?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.41,0:13:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No. Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.13,0:13:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, I suppose it's best not to get worked up and press Rin-chan for details.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.30,0:13:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.28,0:13:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're doing really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.40,0:13:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose we never told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but your mother kept working even after you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Wasn't she always a housewife?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.33,0:13:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When she was pregnant with Kazumi, she pushed herself too hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.89,0:13:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and ended up in hospital for a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And by the time she returned to work, she had been all but pushed out of her job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother was terribly upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And Kazumi was a newborn, and so tiny...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that your mother often had to take time off of work or come home early.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And Kazumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.16,0:13:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother put so much effort into raising Kazumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.13,0:13:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that she ended up like she is now, as loud and rambunctious as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.06,0:14:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? Do you want Dad to drive you to the station?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.89,0:14:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay. We'll get there on time just by walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.97,0:14:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.42,0:14:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She asked if we can come again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.87,0:14:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Auntie will be waiting, so come by whenever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What're you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.85,0:14:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think it'd be nice to give us a grandchild? I could look after the baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.97,0:14:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't keep working and raise a child at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so the woman {\i1}always{\i0} loses out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I still want to wear swimsuits and go drinking and...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin. Was there a computer at Granddad's?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.17,0:15:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know what a computer is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.95,0:15:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.09,0:15:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did Granddad use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The maid used it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.28,0:15:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He had a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,W-What sort of person was she?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.35,0:15:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hate Masako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.93,0:15:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She hated me, and she always got mad at me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.87,0:15:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She was scary, so I forgot all about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.68,0:15:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.92,0:16:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a bit late to be saying this, but it's tough to try and juggle a job and raise a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.58,0:16:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure is. Not a moment's peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Gotou-san, have you ever felt like...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.93,0:16:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...you've sacrificed yourself for your child?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You mean when I was demoted at the company?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I know it's rude of me to ask, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at the time, I thought it was for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And everything turned out okay, so why worry?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.47,0:16:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But even if I felt that way, I'd never come out and say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't underestimate the power of words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... "Kotodama", was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:37.93,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,TL Note: "Kotodama" is an ancient Japanese belief that words and names possess mystical or supernatural power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.46,0:16:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Was that answer too abstract?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I understand completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.34,0:16:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you'll teach me lots more about children.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.65,0:16:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ha! But your kid's much older than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should be teaching me, senpai.{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin... You should've just woken me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.85,0:17:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But... It's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter what it is. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.95,0:17:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you have a nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's it like to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to die before me, Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sadness over Granddad passing away,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:50.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,anxiety over what she'd do if I died...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and her own fear of death...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So many things she couldn't sort out, all jumbled in the back of her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.65,0:18:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to worry about that until you're a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When will I be a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.09,0:18:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No... You don't need to worry about it until you're an old lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.65,0:18:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going anywhere until then!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.23,0:18:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And don't worry about wetting the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.38,0:18:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure you use the toilet before bedtime, and you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.84,0:18:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But going to the toilet is scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go with you at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.77,0:18:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And even if you wet the bed, you just need to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.14,0:18:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will you get mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.21,0:18:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing to get mad about.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.63,0:18:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And nothing to laugh at.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.21,0:18:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what did you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry to call you out on such short notice, Hiraka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.38,0:18:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.41,0:18:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is going to sound sudden, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.76,0:18:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please transfer me to a department where I won't be doing overtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Kawachi, are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Deadly serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.39,0:19:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see, so that's what's happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,From a personal point of view, it's extremely disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I have children, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.48,0:19:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try and put in a good word to the head of the department.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.93,0:19:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. Thank you for all your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But your subordinates aren't going to be pleased...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.04,0:19:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't accept that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why does it have to be you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.09,0:19:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you just ask another relative?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.06,0:19:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I probably shouldn't tell him that I was the one who requested the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.06,0:19:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, aren't there nurseries that watch children until late at night?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.97,0:19:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to work under anyone except you, Kawachi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.31,0:19:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know it's sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.07,0:19:48.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but the higher ups shuffle around the company's hierarchy a lot. {Higher ups doing the shuffling, as opposed to shuffling themselves}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.07,0:19:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no point in getting worked up about it every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm really sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:20:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Things will settle down in my department without me, eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.02,0:20:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They'll be able to deal with a little reshuffling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.42,0:20:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be weird if an organisation couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.83,0:20:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But Rin is different!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.21,0:20:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or at least...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.70,0:20:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm pretty sure I'm right to think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.84,0:20:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.66,0:20:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it done?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.26,0:20:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. This much rice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.17,0:20:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Towel, lunchbox, indoor shoes, toothbrush, cup...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.53,0:20:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We've put your name on them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.71,0:20:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?! A futon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.63,0:20:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right. That's for the infants' class.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.57,0:20:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.62,0:20:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, I'd be lying through my teeth if I said with complete certainty that I wasn't sacrificing something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I hope that several years down the line, I'll be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.61,0:22:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey Rin, that thing you have on your handtowel and lunchbox...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.59,0:22:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know... The dog thing with the long ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.68,0:22:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a lop-eared!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.82,0:22:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lop... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.60,0:22:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? It's not a spotty dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.99,0:22:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a rabbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.29,0:22:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, go to the toilet first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.08,0:22:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I already have!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.95,0:22:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right.{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,##{SIGNS}##
